"""
run_ranger_refresh.py  -  Project Ranger daily refresh (single entry point)

What it does
  1. Pulls 5 source tables from Oracle (ODS + EDW) IN PARALLEL
  2. Stores them as tables in one DuckDB file:  data/ranger.duckdb
  3. Builds the 5-Year Plan + Status Report from those tables
  4. Sends the email report

Schedule it with Task Scheduler:
  Program:   <path to python.exe in the project venv>
  Arguments: run_ranger_refresh.py
  Start in:  <this folder>          (script also works without this)

Exit code 0 = success, 1 = failure (Task Scheduler shows it as "Last Run Result").
Logs: logs/ranger_YYYY-MM-DD.log
"""

